## Blog

### Foundational

- [How SOA Records Support Reliable DNS Zone Transfers](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/how-soa-records-support-reliable-dns-zone-transfers/): Discover how SOA records support reliable DNS zone transfers by coordinating DNS updates, synchronization, refresh intervals, retries, and server communication.
- [How to Secure Business Communications on Public Wi-Fi](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/how-to-secure-business-communications-on-public-wi-fi/): Protect sensitive business communications on public Wi-Fi with practical security strategies that reduce cyber risks, data breaches, and unauthorized access.
- [CNAME vs. A Record: Understanding the Right DNS Choice](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/cname-vs-a-record-understanding-the-right-dns-choice/): Learn the key differences between CNAME and A records, their uses, limitations, and how to choose the right DNS record for your domain.
- [Email Downtime Detection: From Detection To Faster Recovery](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/email-downtime-detection-from-detection-to-faster-recovery/): Learn how email downtime detection identifies outages early, speeds up response, and helps organizations restore email services faster with less disruption.
- [What Is Piggybacking in Cybersecurity? Types, Risks, Real-World Examples, and Prevention](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/what-is-piggybacking-in-cybersecurity-types-risks-prevention-guide/): Learn what piggybacking in cybersecurity means, its types, risks, real-world examples, and prevention strategies to protect against unauthorized access.
- [GDPR Consent Emails For B2B Marketing What You Need To Know ](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/gdpr-consent-emails-b2b-marketing-what-you-need-to-know/): Learn what GDPR consent emails for B2B marketing require, how to stay compliant, avoid common mistakes, and build trust while improving email engagement.
- [No DMARC Record Found: What It Means, Why It Matters, and How to Fix It](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/no-dmarc-record-found-meaning-risks-how-to-fix/): No DMARC record found? Learn what it means, why it puts your domain at risk, and how to create, verify, and manage a DMARC record to stop spoofing.
- [Honey Trap Scams: How Cybercriminals Exploit Trust and How to Avoid Them](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/honey-trap-scams-how-cybercriminals-exploit-trust-and-avoid-them/): Learn how honey trap scams exploit trust through romance and social engineering.
- [How Microsoft 365 Accounts Become Targets For Credential Harvesting Attacks](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/how-microsoft-365-accounts-become-targets-for-credential-harvesting-attacks/): Learn how Microsoft 365 accounts become targets for credential harvesting attacks, common tactics used by cybercriminals, and best practices to stay protected.
- [What Is Ping Spoofing? Understanding How It Works and How to Prevent It](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/what-is-ping-spoofing-and-how-to-prevent-it/): Learn what ping spoofing is, how attackers use ICMP spoofing, the risks it creates, and practical steps to detect and prevent network security threats.

### Intermediate

- [Exchange Sever DKIM Troubleshooting for Large Email Message](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/exchange-sever-dkim-troubleshooting-for-large-email-message/): Learn how to troubleshoot DKIM failures in Exchange Server for large email messages, identify common causes, and restore reliable email authentication.
- [How to Audit Your Email Deliverability Before Launching a Campaign](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/how-to-audit-your-email-deliverability-before-launching-a-campaign/): Audit your email deliverability before launching a campaign to improve inbox placement, avoid spam filters, and maximize open rates and engagement.
- [Session Hijacking Via Email Attack Methods And Warning Signs](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/session-hijacking-via-email-attack-methods-and-warning-signs/): Learn common session hijacking via email attack methods, warning signs, and practical tips to detect threats early and protect your accounts from attackers.
- [9 Ways AI and Automation Improve Email Queue Management](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/9-ways-ai-and-automation-improve-email-queue-management/): Discover 9 ways AI and automation improve email queue management by reducing delays, prioritizing messages, optimizing delivery, and boosting email performance.
- [How OAuth 2.0 Is Changing SMTP Relay Authentication](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/how-oauth-2-0-is-changing-smtp-relay-authentication/): Learn how OAuth 2.0 is transforming SMTP relay authentication with secure, token-based access, stronger email security, and reduced reliance on passwords.
- [Why Email Authentication Alone Doesn't Stop Gmail Threats](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/why-email-authentication-alone-doesn-t-stop-gmail-threats/): Email authentication helps verify senders, but Gmail threats can still exploit compromised accounts, malicious links, and social engineering to reach inboxes.
- [Proven Methods for Corporate Email Cybersecurity Setup](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/proven-methods-for-corporate-email-cybersecurity-setup/): Strengthen corporate email cybersecurity with SPF, DKIM, DMARC, TLS, and monitoring to prevent spoofing, improve deliverability, and protect your brand.
- [Common Email Throttling Mistakes That Lead to Deferred or Rejected Emails ](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/common-email-throttling-mistakes-that-lead-deferred-or-rejected-emails/): Avoid common email throttling mistakes that cause deferred or rejected emails. Learn proven strategies to improve email deliverability and sending success.
- [12 Ways To Maintain Email Deliverability After Completing Email Warm-Up](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/12-ways-maintain-email-deliverability-after-completing-email-warm-up/): Learn 12 proven ways to maintain email deliverability after completing email warm-up, improve inbox placement, protect sender reputation, and boost engagement.
- [10 Email Retention Strategies For Managing High-Volume Mailboxes](https://www.duocircle.com/blog/10-email-retention-strategies-for-managing-high-volume-mailboxes/): Discover 10 email retention strategies for managing high-volume mailboxes, improving compliance, reducing storage costs, and strengthening email security.
